### =========================================================================
### HESTA AIR CONDITIONER (CASPER / ELECTRA) MQTT CONTROL API
### =========================================================================
@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080/api/v1
@deviceId = 05d8a4fd-d7f1-4c62-a70e-a4213552b054
@authToken = YOUR_JWT_TOKEN_HERE

### 1. Bật điều hòa (SET_POWER ON)
POST {{baseUrl}}/devices/{{deviceId}}/air-conditioner/command
#Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "action": "SET_POWER",
  "power": true
}

### 2. Tắt điều hòa (SET_POWER OFF)
POST {{baseUrl}}/devices/{{deviceId}}/air-conditioner/command
#Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "action": "SET_POWER",
  "power": false
}

### 3. Cài đặt nhiệt độ 24°C (SET_TEMPERATURE)
POST {{baseUrl}}/devices/{{deviceId}}/air-conditioner/command
#Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "action": "SET_TEMPERATURE",
  "temperature": 24
}

### 4. Tăng nhiệt độ (+1 độ)
POST {{baseUrl}}/devices/{{deviceId}}/air-conditioner/command
#Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "action": "TEMPERATURE_PLUS"
}

### 5. Giảm nhiệt độ (-1 độ)
POST {{baseUrl}}/devices/{{deviceId}}/air-conditioner/command
#Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "action": "TEMPERATURE_MINUS"
}

### 6. Cài đặt tốc độ quạt (AUTO / LOW / MID / HIGH)
POST {{baseUrl}}/devices/{{deviceId}}/air-conditioner/command
#Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "action": "SET_FAN",
  "fan": "HIGH"
}

### 7. Cài đặt chế độ (AUTO / COOL / DRY / HEAT)
POST {{baseUrl}}/devices/{{deviceId}}/air-conditioner/command
#Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "action": "SET_MODE",
  "mode": "COOL"
}

### 8. Bật đảo gió (SWING)
POST {{baseUrl}}/devices/{{deviceId}}/air-conditioner/command
#Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "action": "SET_SWING",
  "swing": true
}

### 9. Hẹn giờ tắt (SET_TIMER: 2 tiếng 30 phút)
POST {{baseUrl}}/devices/{{deviceId}}/air-conditioner/command
#Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "action": "SET_TIMER",
  "hour": 2,
  "halfHour": true
}

### 10. Hủy hẹn giờ (CANCEL_TIMER)
POST {{baseUrl}}/devices/{{deviceId}}/air-conditioner/command
#Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "action": "CANCEL_TIMER"
}

### 11. Yêu cầu thiết bị gửi trạng thái mới nhất (GET_STATE)
POST {{baseUrl}}/devices/{{deviceId}}/air-conditioner/command
#Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "action": "GET_STATE"
}

### 12. Điều khiển nhanh qua Query Param endpoint
POST {{baseUrl}}/devices/{{deviceId}}/air-conditioner/temperature?temperature=26
#Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
